{%- comment -%}
  ============================================================
  CART DRAWER — carrinho lateral
  ============================================================

  O QUE FAZ:
  Carrinho em painel lateral, renderizado como SECTION justamente
  para poder ser re-renderizado pela Section Rendering API do
  Shopify: cada operação de carrinho (add / change / remove) devolve
  o HTML novo desta section na MESMA requisição, e o JS só troca o
  conteúdo. Nenhum reload, nenhuma segunda chamada a /cart.js.

  ONDE É USADA:
  layout/theme.liquid, via {% section 'cart-drawer' %} — precisa ser
  section estática no layout para a Section Rendering API alcançá-la.

  ESTRUTURA (3 regiões, ver <style>):
    HEADER            fixo    — título, contagem, fechar
    PROGRESSO FRETE   fixo    — é status, fica sempre visível
    ITENS + BUMP      rola    — só esta região tem overflow
    RESUMO + CTA      fixo    — o "finalizar" nunca sai da tela
  Isso é deliberado: com 8 itens no carrinho o botão de checkout
  continua acessível sem rolar.

  O QUE NÃO É RE-RENDERIZADO:
  A raiz [data-cart-drawer] e a região aria-live sobrevivem à troca
  de conteúdo — a raiz porque guarda a classe .is-open, e a live
  region porque recriá-la faria o leitor de tela reanunciar tudo.

  ORDER BUMP (setting bump_mode):
  - off      — nada.
  - manual   — produto escolhido no theme editor.
  - auto     — recomendação complementar real do Shopify, buscada
               pelo JS em /recommendations/products (section
               'cart-recommendations') a partir do 1º item do
               carrinho. Sem recomendação configurada na loja, o
               bloco simplesmente não aparece.

  SOBRE PREÇO DO BUMP:
  Mostra o preço REAL do produto. Se houver compare_at_price
  cadastrado no admin, aparece o preço antigo riscado. Não existe
  setting de "desconto" fictício: um preço inventado aqui não
  chegaria no checkout e viraria promessa quebrada.

  DADOS REAIS APENAS:
  Formas de pagamento vêm de shop.enabled_payment_types. Não há
  contador, escassez inventada ou "X pessoas vendo" em lugar nenhum.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign threshold = section.settings.free_shipping_threshold | times: 100 | round
  assign show_progress = false
  if section.settings.show_free_shipping and threshold > 0
    assign show_progress = true
    assign remaining = threshold | minus: cart.total_price
    if remaining <= 0
      assign goal_reached = true
      assign progress = 100
    else
      assign goal_reached = false
      assign progress = cart.total_price | times: 100 | divided_by: threshold
      assign remaining_money = remaining | money
    endif
  endif

  assign bump_product = null
  if section.settings.bump_mode == 'manual' and section.settings.bump_product != blank
    assign bump_product = all_products[section.settings.bump_product]
  endif

  comment
    O bump não pode oferecer o que já está no carrinho.
  endcomment
  if bump_product
    for item in cart.items
      if item.product_id == bump_product.id
        assign bump_product = null
        break
      endif
    endfor
  endif

  assign trust_blocks = section.blocks | where: 'type', 'trust'
-%}

<div
  id="CartDrawer"
  class="cart-drawer"
  data-cart-drawer
  data-cart-type="{{ settings.cart_type }}"
  data-bump-mode="{{ section.settings.bump_mode }}"
  data-added-message="{{ 'sections.cart.item_added' | t | escape }}"
  data-removed-message="{{ 'sections.cart.item_removed' | t | escape }}"
  data-error-message="{{ 'sections.cart.cart_error' | t | escape }}"
  {% if cart.items.size > 0 %}data-bump-product-id="{{ cart.items.first.product_id }}"{% endif %}
>
  {%- comment -%} Persistente: recriar isso reanunciaria a cada update. {%- endcomment -%}
  <p class="visually-hidden" role="status" aria-live="polite" data-cart-status></p>

  <div data-cart-drawer-inner>
    <div class="cart-drawer__scrim" data-cart-close tabindex="-1"></div>

    <aside
      class="cart-drawer__panel scheme-dark"
      role="dialog"
      aria-modal="true"
      aria-label="{{ 'sections.cart.title' | t }}"
      data-cart-panel
    >
      <header class="cart-drawer__header">
        <h2 class="cart-drawer__title">
          {{ 'sections.cart.title' | t }}
          {%- if cart.item_count > 0 -%}
            <span class="cart-drawer__count">
              {{- 'sections.cart.item_count' | t: count: cart.item_count -}}
            </span>
          {%- endif -%}
        </h2>
        <button type="button" class="cart-drawer__close tap-target" data-cart-close aria-label="{{ 'sections.cart.close' | t }}">
          {% render 'icon', name: 'close' %}
        </button>
      </header>

      {%- if cart.item_count == 0 -%}
        {%- comment -%} Vazio: editorial, não uma tela de erro. {%- endcomment -%}
        <div class="cart-drawer__empty">
          <p class="cart-drawer__empty-title">{{ 'sections.cart.empty' | t }}</p>
          {%- if section.settings.empty_text != blank -%}
            <p class="cart-drawer__empty-text">{{ section.settings.empty_text | escape }}</p>
          {%- endif -%}
          <a href="{{ section.settings.empty_link | default: routes.all_products_collection_url }}" class="button cart-drawer__empty-cta">
            {{ section.settings.empty_button_label | default: 'general.continue_shopping' | t }}
            {% render 'icon', name: 'arrow-right' %}
          </a>

          {%- liquid
            assign empty_collection = collections[section.settings.empty_collection]
            assign empty_products = empty_collection.products
          -%}
          {%- if empty_products.size > 0 -%}
            <div class="cart-drawer__suggestions">
              <p class="eyebrow">{{ 'sections.cart.suggestions' | t }}</p>
              <ul class="cart-drawer__suggestion-list" role="list">
                {%- for product in empty_products limit: 2 -%}
                  <li class="cart-drawer__suggestion">
                    <a href="{{ product.url }}" class="cart-drawer__suggestion-link">
                      {%- if product.featured_media -%}
                        {{
                          product.featured_media
                          | image_url: width: 200
                          | image_tag:
                            loading: 'lazy',
                            widths: '100, 200',
                            sizes: '64px',
                            class: 'cart-drawer__suggestion-image',
                            alt: product.featured_media.alt | default: product.title | escape
                        }}
                      {%- endif -%}
                      <span class="cart-drawer__suggestion-copy">
                        <span class="cart-drawer__suggestion-title">{{ product.title | escape }}</span>
                        <span class="cart-drawer__suggestion-price">{{ product.price | money }}</span>
                      </span>
                    </a>
                  </li>
                {%- endfor -%}
              </ul>
            </div>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>
      {%- else -%}
        {%- if show_progress -%}
          <div class="cart-drawer__progress {% if goal_reached %}is-reached{% endif %}">
            <p class="cart-drawer__progress-label">
              {%- if goal_reached -%}
                <span class="cart-drawer__progress-check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
                {{ 'sections.cart.free_shipping_reached' | t }}
              {%- else -%}
                {{ 'sections.cart.free_shipping_remaining_html' | t: amount: remaining_money }}
              {%- endif -%}
            </p>
            <div
              class="cart-drawer__progress-track"
              role="progressbar"
              aria-valuemin="0"
              aria-valuemax="100"
              aria-valuenow="{{ progress }}"
            >
              <span class="cart-drawer__progress-bar" style="width: {{ progress }}%;"></span>
            </div>
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- comment -%} Única região com overflow (ver <style>). {%- endcomment -%}
        <div class="cart-drawer__scroll" data-cart-scroll>
          <ul class="cart-drawer__items" role="list">
            {%- for item in cart.items -%}
              <li class="cart-item-drawer" data-cart-line="{{ forloop.index }}">
                <a href="{{ item.url }}" class="cart-item-drawer__media" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">
                  {%- if item.image -%}
                    {{
                      item.image
                      | image_url: width: 300
                      | image_tag:
                        loading: 'lazy',
                        widths: '100, 200, 300',
                        sizes: '88px',
                        class: 'cart-item-drawer__image',
                        alt: item.image.alt | escape
                    }}
                  {%- endif -%}
                </a>

                <div class="cart-item-drawer__body">
                  <div class="cart-item-drawer__top">
                    <a href="{{ item.url }}" class="cart-item-drawer__name">{{ item.product.title | escape }}</a>
                    <span class="cart-item-drawer__price">{{ item.final_line_price | money }}</span>
                  </div>

                  {%- unless item.product.has_only_default_variant -%}
                    <p class="cart-item-drawer__variant">
                      {%- for option in item.options_with_values -%}
                        {{- option.value | escape -}}{%- unless forloop.last %} / {% endunless -%}
                      {%- endfor -%}
                    </p>
                  {%- endunless -%}

                  {%- if item.line_level_discount_allocations.size > 0 -%}
                    <ul class="cart-item-drawer__discounts" role="list">
                      {%- for discount in item.line_level_discount_allocations -%}
                        <li>{{ discount.discount_application.title | escape }} (−{{ discount.amount | money }})</li>
                      {%- endfor -%}
                    </ul>
                  {%- endif -%}

                  <div class="cart-item-drawer__actions">
                    <div class="quantity-drawer">
                      <button
                        type="button"
                        class="quantity-drawer__button"
                        data-cart-change="{{ forloop.index }}"
                        data-cart-quantity="{{ item.quantity | minus: 1 }}"
                        aria-label="{{ 'sections.cart.decrease' | t: title: item.product.title }}"
                      >−</button>
                      <span class="quantity-drawer__value" aria-live="off">{{ item.quantity }}</span>
                      <button
                        type="button"
                        class="quantity-drawer__button"
                        data-cart-change="{{ forloop.index }}"
                        data-cart-quantity="{{ item.quantity | plus: 1 }}"
                        aria-label="{{ 'sections.cart.increase' | t: title: item.product.title }}"
                      >+</button>
                    </div>

                    <button
                      type="button"
                      class="cart-item-drawer__remove"
                      data-cart-change="{{ forloop.index }}"
                      data-cart-quantity="0"
                      aria-label="{{ 'sections.cart.remove_title' | t: title: item.product.title }}"
                    >{{ 'sections.cart.remove' | t }}</button>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </li>
            {%- endfor -%}
          </ul>

          {%- comment -%}
            Order bump. No modo 'auto' o slot nasce vazio e o JS
            preenche com a recomendação real; sem recomendação, o
            slot continua vazio e nada é exibido.
          {%- endcomment -%}
          {%- if section.settings.bump_mode == 'manual' and bump_product -%}
            <div class="cart-bump" data-cart-bump>
              <p class="eyebrow">{{ section.settings.bump_title | default: 'sections.cart.bump_title' | t }}</p>
              {%- if section.settings.bump_text != blank -%}
                <p class="cart-bump__intro">{{ section.settings.bump_text | escape }}</p>
              {%- endif -%}
              {% render 'cart-bump-product', product: bump_product %}
            </div>
          {%- elsif section.settings.bump_mode == 'auto' -%}
            <div class="cart-bump" data-cart-bump hidden>
              <p class="eyebrow">{{ section.settings.bump_title | default: 'sections.cart.bump_title' | t }}</p>
              {%- if section.settings.bump_text != blank -%}
                <p class="cart-bump__intro">{{ section.settings.bump_text | escape }}</p>
              {%- endif -%}
              <div data-cart-bump-slot></div>
            </div>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>

        <footer class="cart-drawer__footer">
          {%- if cart.cart_level_discount_applications.size > 0 -%}
            <ul class="cart-drawer__discounts" role="list">
              {%- for discount in cart.cart_level_discount_applications -%}
                <li>{{ discount.title | escape }} (−{{ discount.total_allocated_amount | money }})</li>
              {%- endfor -%}
            </ul>
          {%- endif -%}

          <div class="cart-drawer__totals">
            <span class="cart-drawer__totals-label">{{ 'sections.cart.subtotal' | t }}</span>
            <span class="cart-drawer__totals-value">{{ cart.total_price | money }}</span>
          </div>
          <p class="cart-drawer__tax-note">{{ 'sections.cart.taxes_and_shipping_at_checkout' | t }}</p>

          <form action="{{ routes.cart_url }}" method="post" novalidate>
            <button type="submit" name="checkout" class="button cart-drawer__checkout">
              {{ 'sections.cart.checkout' | t }}
              {% render 'icon', name: 'arrow-right' %}
            </button>
          </form>

          {%- if shop.enabled_payment_types.size > 0 -%}
            <div class="cart-drawer__payment">
              <span class="cart-drawer__payment-label">{{ 'sections.cart.secure_payment' | t }}</span>
              <ul class="cart-drawer__payment-icons" role="list" aria-label="{{ 'sections.footer.payment' | t }}">
                {%- for type in shop.enabled_payment_types limit: 6 -%}
                  <li>{{ type | payment_type_svg_tag: class: 'cart-drawer__payment-icon' }}</li>
                {%- endfor -%}
              </ul>
            </div>
          {%- endif -%}

          {%- if trust_blocks.size > 0 -%}
            <ul class="cart-drawer__trust" role="list">
              {%- for block in trust_blocks -%}
                {%- if block.settings.text != blank -%}
                  <li {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>{{ block.settings.text | escape }}</li>
                {%- endif -%}
              {%- endfor -%}
            </ul>
          {%- endif -%}
        </footer>
      {%- endif -%}
    </aside>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  /* ==========================================================
     Raiz: cobre o viewport, mas so intercepta cliques aberta.
     ========================================================== */
  .cart-drawer {
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 900;
    visibility: hidden;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .cart-drawer.is-open { visibility: visible; pointer-events: auto; }

  .cart-drawer__scrim {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background-color: var(--color-scrim);
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 340ms cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);
  }
  .cart-drawer.is-open .cart-drawer__scrim { opacity: 1; }

  .cart-drawer__panel {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    right: 0;
    height: 100%;
    width: min(100%, 460px);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    background-color: var(--color-background);
    border-left: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    transform: translateX(100%);
    transition: transform 340ms cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);
  }
  .cart-drawer.is-open .cart-drawer__panel { transform: none; }

  /* ---- Header (fixo) ---- */
  .cart-drawer__header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 16px;
    padding: 24px var(--space-block, 28px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .cart-drawer__title {
    font-family: var(--font-ui-family);
    font-size: var(--f1);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-semibold);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-label);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .cart-drawer__count { color: var(--color-text-muted); font-weight: var(--font-weight-regular); }
  .cart-drawer__count::before { content: ' · '; }
  .cart-drawer__close {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: none;
    border: none;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: color 200ms ease;
  }
  .cart-drawer__close:hover { color: var(--color-text-primary); }
  .cart-drawer__close svg { width: 18px; height: 18px; }

  /* ---- Progresso de frete (fixo, e status) ---- */
  .cart-drawer__progress {
    padding: 18px var(--space-block, 28px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .cart-drawer__progress-label {
    font-family: var(--font-ui-family);
    font-size: var(--f0);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-label);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    margin: 0 0 10px;
  }
  .cart-drawer__progress.is-reached .cart-drawer__progress-label { color: var(--color-accent-readable); }
  .cart-drawer__progress-check { margin-right: 6px; }
  .cart-drawer__progress-track {
    height: 2px;
    background-color: var(--color-border-strong);
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .cart-drawer__progress-bar {
    display: block;
    height: 100%;
    background-color: var(--color-accent);
    transition: width 420ms cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);
  }

  /* ---- Itens + bump: a UNICA regiao que rola ---- */
  .cart-drawer__scroll {
    flex: 1 1 auto;
    overflow-y: auto;
    overscroll-behavior: contain;
    -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
  }
  .cart-drawer__items { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

  .cart-item-drawer {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 88px 1fr;
    gap: 16px;
    padding: 20px var(--space-block, 28px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }
  .cart-item-drawer__media { display: block; background-color: var(--color-surface); }
  .cart-item-drawer__image { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; }
  .cart-item-drawer__body { min-width: 0; }
  .cart-item-drawer__top { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; }
  .cart-item-drawer__name {
    font-family: var(--font-ui-family);
    font-size: var(--f1);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-medium);
    line-height: var(--leading-ui);
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .cart-item-drawer__name:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  .cart-item-drawer__price {
    font-family: var(--font-ui-family);
    font-size: var(--f1);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-semibold);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .cart-item-drawer__variant {
    font-family: var(--font-ui-family);
    font-size: var(--f0);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-label);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin: 6px 0 0;
  }
  .cart-item-drawer__discounts {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 6px 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    font-size: var(--f0);
    color: var(--color-accent-readable);
  }
  .cart-item-drawer__actions {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 14px;
  }

  .quantity-drawer {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--inputs-radius, 6px);
  }
  .quantity-drawer__button {
    width: 34px;
    height: 34px;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: none;
    border: none;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    font-family: var(--font-ui-family);
    font-size: var(--f2);
    line-height: 1;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: color 200ms ease;
  }
  .quantity-drawer__button:hover { color: var(--color-text-primary); }
  .quantity-drawer__value {
    min-width: 28px;
    text-align: center;
    font-family: var(--font-ui-family);
    font-size: var(--f1);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .cart-item-drawer__remove {
    background: none;
    border: none;
    padding: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-ui-family);
    font-size: var(--f0);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-label);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: color 200ms ease;
  }
  .cart-item-drawer__remove:hover { color: var(--color-text-primary); }

  /* ---- Order bump: pequeno, ignoravel, sem pressao ---- */
  .cart-bump {
    padding: 20px var(--space-block, 28px);
    background-color: var(--color-surface);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }
  .cart-bump__intro {
    font-size: var(--f1);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    margin: 10px 0 16px;
  }

  /* ---- Resumo + CTA (fixos) ---- */
  .cart-drawer__footer {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    padding: 20px var(--space-block, 28px) calc(20px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px));
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    background-color: var(--color-background);
  }
  .cart-drawer__discounts {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    padding: 0;
    font-size: var(--f0);
    color: var(--color-accent-readable);
  }
  .cart-drawer__totals {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 16px;
  }
  .cart-drawer__totals-label {
    font-family: var(--font-ui-family);
    font-size: var(--f0);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-label);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }
  .cart-drawer__totals-value {
    font-family: var(--font-ui-family);
    font-size: var(--f4);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-semibold);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .cart-drawer__tax-note {
    font-size: var(--f0);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin: 4px 0 16px;
  }
  .cart-drawer__checkout { width: 100%; }

  .cart-drawer__payment {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 12px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-top: 16px;
  }
  .cart-drawer__payment-label {
    font-family: var(--font-ui-family);
    font-size: var(--f0);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-label);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }
  .cart-drawer__payment-icons { display: flex; gap: 4px; list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .cart-drawer__payment-icon { width: 30px; height: 20px; }

  .cart-drawer__trust {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 4px 16px;
    list-style: none;
    margin: 14px 0 0;
    padding: 0;
  }
  .cart-drawer__trust li {
    font-size: var(--f0);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }
  .cart-drawer__trust li::before { content: '✓ '; color: var(--color-accent-readable); }

  /* ---- Vazio ---- */
  .cart-drawer__empty {
    flex: 1 1 auto;
    overflow-y: auto;
    padding: var(--space-block, 28px);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }
  .cart-drawer__empty-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display-family);
    font-size: var(--f5);
    line-height: var(--leading-heading);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-heading);
    margin: 8px 0 10px;
  }
  .cart-drawer__empty-text {
    font-size: var(--f1);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    margin: 0 0 24px;
    max-width: 30ch;
  }
  .cart-drawer__empty-cta { align-self: stretch; }
  .cart-drawer__suggestions { margin-top: auto; padding-top: 40px; width: 100%; }
  .cart-drawer__suggestions .eyebrow { margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .cart-drawer__suggestion-list { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: 12px; }
  .cart-drawer__suggestion-link {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
  }
  .cart-drawer__suggestion-image { width: 64px; height: auto; display: block; background-color: var(--color-surface); }
  .cart-drawer__suggestion-copy { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; }
  .cart-drawer__suggestion-title { font-size: var(--f1); font-weight: var(--font-weight-medium); }
  .cart-drawer__suggestion-price { font-size: var(--f0); color: var(--color-text-muted); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .cart-drawer__suggestion-link:hover .cart-drawer__suggestion-title { text-decoration: underline; }

  /* Estado ocupado: feedback de que algo esta acontecendo, sem spinner */
  /* ==========================================================
     ATUALIZANDO — o valor que vai mudar avisa que está mudando
     ==========================================================
     A lista inteira já perdia presença enquanto o fetch acontecia.
     Faltava o subtotal: ele continuava firme mostrando um número
     VELHO, que muda um instante depois — a pessoa lê duas vezes e
     desconfia. Agora ele pulsa no lugar, com a mesma linguagem de
     espera do resto do tema (.skeleton, em base.css), e mantém a
     própria largura: nada salta quando o novo valor chega. */
  .cart-drawer[data-busy='true'] .cart-drawer__scroll { opacity: 0.55; transition: opacity 160ms ease; }
  .cart-drawer[data-busy='true'] .cart-drawer__panel { cursor: progress; }
  .cart-drawer[data-busy='true'] .cart-drawer__totals-value {
    color: transparent;
    border-radius: var(--radius-xs);
    background-color: var(--color-surface-elevated);
    animation: skeletonPulse 1.6s var(--ease-in-out) infinite;
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .cart-drawer[data-busy='true'] .cart-drawer__totals-value { animation: none; }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    /* Largura total; o painel usa a altura real do viewport para o
       CTA nao ficar atras da barra do navegador. */
    .cart-drawer__panel {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100dvh;
      border-left: none;
    }
    .cart-drawer__header,
    .cart-drawer__progress,
    .cart-item-drawer,
    .cart-bump,
    .cart-drawer__footer,
    .cart-drawer__empty { --space-block: 20px; }
    .cart-item-drawer { grid-template-columns: 76px 1fr; }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .cart-drawer__panel,
    .cart-drawer__scrim,
    .cart-drawer__progress-bar { transition-duration: 0.01ms !important; }
  }
</style>

